# The .moqtrace corpus is byte-exact: a checked-in file is the evidence, and
# a reader that disagrees with it is the finding. Git classifies these as
# binary today only because they happen to contain NUL bytes, and a smaller
# case that happens not to would be line-ending-converted on a `core.autocrlf`
# checkout — CBOR silently corrupted by the one tool nobody suspects.
*.moqtrace binary
